    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "August B. Pust built a more than thirty-year public-service career around citizen diplomacy, multicultural relations, and international exchange. He coordinated trade, humanitarian, educational, cultural, and goodwill missions, developed programs for young professionals and civil-society partners, and helped connect municipal, regional, state, and university leaders through people-to-people global partnerships."
    ]
